# Chapter I, the Fur Seal Tavern: wearing the ring, the player leaves the
# monastery by its gate, which skips ahead to the evening at the tavern.
# Sagrim drinks the player under the table, a stranger arrives looking for
# the player and takes them away to his room by the port.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from taverne_gate
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# The gate by Brother Tromi; the evening's message, then the tavern.
case taverne_gate
activate 05D7F428
button 0
until 600 GetPCCell "Melee, Fur Seal Tavern" == 1
expect Storyvar == 1
end

# Sagrim counts the beers until the player feels funny.
case taverne_sagrim
talk ANFTaverneSagrim
expect GetJournalIndex A_I_Taverne == 1
ask much wes drink?
choose 1
choose 2
choose 4
choose 6
bye
until 120 Storyvar == 2
end

# Someone comes through the door: the stranger walks up, asks who the player
# is, and takes them away.
case taverne_stranger
until 900 "ANFTaverneBote"->GetDistance player <= 300
wait 60
ask looking for you
expect GetJournalIndex A_I_Taverne == 2
choose 1
choose 2
choose 3
bye
until 600 GetJournalIndex A_I_Taverne == 3
until 600 Storyvar == 3
end
